				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Project): Wire state handlers to trait implementations\n\nCross-cutting submodule sync wiring Mountain handlers to proper trait implementations for state persistence:\n1. Mountain: Replace direct Sky event emissions with trait methods - SCM handlers use SourceControlManagementProvider to materialize state in ApplicationState::SourceControl, StatusBar handlers use StatusBarProvider::SetStatusBarEntry for ActiveStatusBarItems, Webview handlers use WebviewProvider trait for ApplicationState::WebviewState, Search handlers delegate to WorkspaceProvider::FindFilesInWorkspace and SearchProvider::TextSearch\n2. Output: Remove Configuration directory (ESBuild, Plugin, Polyfill, Service configs and tsconfig)\n3. Cocoon: Submodule sync to cbaf44f1\n\nImpact: SCM providers, status bar items, and webview panels now properly persist in Mountain's ApplicationState. File and text search use ignore-aware implementations.",
			"SHA": "ef6da240b1d22fe8249f99b2f3955b7bed1a154d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-24T23:16:30Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				5214,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Add regex and multiline search to TextSearchQuery\n\nSync Mountain and Cocoon submodules with new search capabilities:\n- Mountain: Add `isRegExp` and `isMultiline` fields mirroring VS Code's ITextSearchQuery\n- Escape plain-text search patterns via regex::escape() to prevent crashes on metacharacters like `.`, `(`, `[`, `*`, `?`\n- Add .multi_line() support for multiline regex searches\n- Fixes Search view plain-text mode broken for queries containing `obj.method(` or `file[1].txt`\n- Cocoon: Update to d4763554\n\nImpact: Plain-text search now works correctly for queries containing regex metacharacters without crashing the regex compiler.",
			"SHA": "955a8545bf99cedb0b1db11ad25ed773a5c4d2b3"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-24T23:05:50Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				5214,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Wire search IPC handlers to trait implementations\n\nReplace naive inline fs-walk implementations in Search.rs with delegations to properly-implemented trait methods on MountainEnvironment:\n- handle_search_find_in_files → SearchProvider::TextSearch (grep-searcher + ignore::WalkBuilder with parallel walking)\n- handle_search_find_files → WorkspaceProvider::FindFilesInWorkspace (ignore-aware glob walker with .gitignore support)\n\nThe inline implementations had multiple deficiencies: naive starts_with('.') hidden-file skipping (doesn't honour .gitignore), no regex engine, bogus format!(\"file://{}\") URI constructor, and single-threaded walkers. The trait implementations were reachable only through Environment.Require<dyn SearchProvider>() calls and no IPC handler ever issued those.\n\nAlso change FileReaddirNative.rs log level from vfs-verbose to vfs since readdir fires at most once per folder expand (unlike stat which fires per probe) and is the primary observable for Explorer view diagnostics.\n\nImpact: File search and find-files now use proper ignore rules, parallel walking, and regex support instead of naive single-threaded implementations.",
			"SHA": "ab81979739d237da5c6179b32dcdf7437a7a83ae"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-24T22:56:21Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				5214,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Add DisableUnusedServices transform and sync dependencies across submodules\n\nCross-cutting Element submodule sync with functional improvements and dependency updates:\n\n1. Output: Add DisableUnusedServices ESBuild transform - Replaces upstream VS Code contribution barrels for features Land doesn't back (auto-update, issue reporter, MS account/sync, process explorer) with inert stubs. Removes broken UI surfaces and silences \"service not registered\" warnings, shortening boot time.\n\n2. Output: Fix ExtensionScannerIPC path matching - Now matches BOTH electron-browser AND browser variants of extensionsScannerService.js. Previously only matched electron-browser, but desktop.main.js loads the browser variant.\n\n3. Sky: Sync dependency updates - @xterm/xterm: 6.1.0-beta.202 → 6.1.0-beta.203, @astrojs/compiler-rs: 0.1.9 → 0.1.10, pozil/auto-assign-issue: 2.2.0 → 3.0.0\n\nImpact: Extension scanning now works correctly for desktop profile. Unused VS Code services are stubbed out, reducing boot noise and improving startup time.",
			"SHA": "4c908a36d5a2b16ff9ab9e0e5dbc8c6964566d17"
		}
	],
